h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 600)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Optimized media now includes QuickTimes.</b> File &#9656; Optimized Media &#9656; Optimize This Shot (or the whole session) makes a light stand-in for movies as well as image sequences, so a session of 4K ProRes 444 plays smoothly off the network the same way renders do. The stand-in keeps the movie&#8217;s color, numbering, and sound; the original stays the source for exports and full-resolution inspection. Optimized session bundles pick up movies too.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
